  "name": "Adopt",
  "kind": "function",
  "responsibility": "Makes a settled draft current, or gives a board nobody had built its first current variant; refuses a draft derived from an architecture a later adoption superseded unless forced",
  "description": "Adoption renames nothing and rewrites no history: the variant that was current becomes a historical state under its own name. On a board with no current variant nothing becomes history (ADR 0031). A draft standing on a historical variant would drop what was adopted over it, so it is refused as PARENT_SUPERSEDED unless the request forces it, and the adoption record then says it was forced (ADR 0037).",
